NetBoxAPI generated sources
===========================

`Sources/NetBoxAPI/Client.swift` and `Sources/NetBoxAPI/Types.swift` are
generated by apple/swift-openapi-generator 1.13.0 from a path-filtered
subset of the NetBox REST API schema.

Do not edit those two files. Regenerate with:

    Scripts/regenerate-netbox-client.sh

